# 19 real reference-image uploads (~271MB) had accumulated here and were
# committed — this directory was missing from the ignore list that already
# covers its two siblings above. Media lives in S3/GCS at runtime; nothing
# reads from this local path (confirmed unreferenced outside save-media.js's
# unrelated `references/` *storage key* prefix, which is a different thing).
/public/references/*
!/public/references/.gitkeep
/data/*.json
depth-worker/.venv
depth-worker/.worker-id
.vercel
.env*
!.env.local.example
!backend/.env.example
vercel-gcp-cred.json
test.json
tsconfig.tsbuildinfo
*.pyc

# Local-only GCP tooling/scratch — these were committed by accident in the
# past (gcp-sa-key.json and hmac.json were always empty placeholders, never a
# real leaked key, but the filenames are exactly the shape a real secret
# would have; cloud-sql-proxy is a ~32MB per-platform downloadable binary,
# not source — see infra/gcp/README.md for how to fetch it locally).
cloud-sql-proxy
gcp-sa-key.json
hmac.json
build*.log

# Local Claude Code / Cowork session settings — machine-specific, not shared repo config.
.claude/

# Historical local OAuth caches must NEVER be committed — this repo is
# public, and the file holds a live access_token/refresh_token pair. Runtime
# reads it only as a local fallback (object storage and env vars come first in
# loadToken), so untracking it costs production nothing.
.higgsfield-mcp-token.json

# Local evaluation fixtures can hold real face-identity images. This repo is
# public; real people's faces never belong in git history.
scripts/eval-fixtures/
scripts/eval-results/

# Design records written by the council skill stay local. They have held
# provider account URLs and captured response headers.
.council/

# Source handoff archives from scripts/package-project-zip.py.
/*.zip
/*.zip.sha256

# Browser verification artifacts may contain session data.
/playwright-report/
/test-results/
